([261] By this phrase we mean always _in relative proportion_, so that the) Tj T*
(value of A is to that of B, as the cost of A is to that of B.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([262] Put in proximate and practical language, the amount of ore that can) Tj T*
(be taken profitably from a mine depends jointly on the price of the ore) Tj T*
(at the surface and the wages of labor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([263] A rise of the exchange value of the specific product of labor) Tj T*
(compensates for superior disutility by enabling the laborer to purchase) Tj T*
(things of higher esteem value with his enhanced wages. In other words,) Tj T*
(we have been explaining the familiar doctrine that wages tend to be) Tj T*
(higher in employments of higher cost. If a laborer were free to choose) Tj T*
(the precise length of his own working day, he would stop when the final) Tj T*
(disutility of the labor and the utility of the commodities purchased by) Tj T*
(the marginal increment of wages are equivalent.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([264] Or, as Walsh states, it may also be defined as the article?s) Tj T*
(purchasing power over all goods including itself. This is not the same) Tj T*
(concept, but is one equally entitled to the name ?general purchasing) Tj T*
(power.? _Op. cit._, p. 13.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
([265] The meaning of this condition, it is hoped, will be apparent from) Tj T*
(the discussion in section 6.) Tj T*
